stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Streaming: fence arrives
    Streaming --> CodeBlock: still streaming
    Streaming --> Gates: document settled
    Gates --> CodeBlock: source > 32768 chars
    Gates --> Rendering: source OK
    Rendering --> CodeBlock: render throws / empty SVG
    Rendering --> Sanitize: SVG produced
    Sanitize --> CodeBlock: active content found
    Sanitize --> Inline: clean SVG
    Inline --> [*]
    CodeBlock --> [*]: graceful degradation
